    answer: '<p>Most routers use these default addresses:</p><ul><li><strong>192.168.1.1</strong> or <strong>192.168.0.1</strong> (most common)</li><li><strong>10.0.0.1</strong> (some ISP routers)</li><li><strong>router.asus.com</strong>, <strong>routerlogin.net</strong> (brand-specific)</li></ul><p>Type the address in your browser while connected to WiFi. Default login is often admin/admin or printed on the router itself.</p>'
