  {
    question: 'Should I hide my WiFi network name (SSID)?',
    answer: '<p><strong>It\'s not necessary and can cause problems.</strong> Hidden networks:</p><ul><li>Still broadcast their presence (just not the name)</li><li>Can cause connection issues with some devices</li><li>Don\'t provide meaningful security</li></ul><p>Better security comes from strong encryption (WPA3/WPA2) and a good password, not hiding the network.</p>'
  },
  {
